+  - Added durable `ensure_database_service` execution to `worker.Provisioner`.
+  - Added typed payload parsing and validation for `ensure_database_service`, including job/payload scope consistency and closed-set engine validation (`postgres`, `mysql`, `mariadb`, `mongo`, `redis`).
+  - Added tenant-scoped database service desired-state reload, service kind verification, parent environment Dokploy ref lookup, idempotent database ensure/replay through the typed Dokploy client, stale desired-version checks before and after upstream calls, and `dokploy_refs` persistence with `dokploy_resource='database'`.
+  - Added fake Dokploy coverage for success/replay, retryable upstream failure, terminal validation/stale/wrong-kind paths, cancellation, and redacted queue error persistence.
+  - Documented the database-service engine payload convention in `internal/controlplane/worker/AGENTS.md`.
